    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9707" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντεπι-τίθημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put on in exchange,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				58.7
			</span></i>(
				Pass.
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐπιστολὴν πρός τινα</span>
			<i>give</i> a letter <i>in answer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.129
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				49
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				17.5.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>make a counter-attack, throw oneself upon,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				36.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.661
			</span></i>; simply, <i>attack,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				2.111
			</span></i>:—
				Act.
			 in same sense, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλλήλοισιν</span>
			<i>make</i> mutual <i>plots,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				17
			</span></i>.</div>
